{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09104","headline":"赠丘员外二首 一 · 韦应物","name":"赠丘员外二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高词弃浮靡，贞行表乡闾。\n未真南宫拜，聊偃东山居。\n大藩本多事，日与文章疎。\n每一覩之子，高咏遂起予。\n宵昼方连燕，烦恡亦顿祛。\n格言雅诲阙，善谑矜数余。\n久局思游旷，穷惨遇阳舒。\n虎丘惬登眺，吴门怅踌躇。\n方此恋携手，岂云还旧墟。\n告诸吴子弟，文学爲何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09104.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09104","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}